This distribution of oneDNN supports systems based on
@DNNL_ARCH_NAME@ architecture.

The library is optimized for RISC-V 64-bit (RV64) architecture-based processors
with the following ISA extensions:
* RISC-V Vector (RVV) extension, version 1.0
* Zvfh (FP16 vector) and Zvfbfwma (BF16 vector)

oneDNN detects the instruction set architecture (ISA) at runtime and uses
just-in-time (JIT) code generation to deploy the code optimized
for the latest supported ISA.

Validated on:
* Sophgo SG2044 (T-Head C920v2, RVV 1.0, VLEN=128) with RISC-V GNU Toolchain 14.2
* Spacemit(R) X100 (RVA23, VLEN=256) with RISC-V GNU Toolchain 15.2
